1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,079
This is the DevOps loop.

2
00:00:02,629 --> 00:00:05,381
Every app you use goes around it, again and again.

3
00:00:07,131 --> 00:00:08,240
On the left, Dev.

4
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:09,963
On the right, Ops.

5
00:00:10,513 --> 00:00:12,988
DevOps joins them into one endless loop.

6
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:16,906
Plan.

7
00:00:17,106 --> 00:00:18,834
Decide what to build, and why.

8
00:00:19,034 --> 00:00:20,463
Track the work in GitHub.

9
00:00:21,613 --> 00:00:22,360
Code.

10
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,755
Developers write it,

11
00:00:23,855 --> 00:00:25,604
and track every change in Git.

12
00:00:26,754 --> 00:00:27,479
Build.

13
00:00:27,679 --> 00:00:29,258
Turn the code into a program,

14
00:00:29,358 --> 00:00:30,809
with a tool like Maven.

15
00:00:31,959 --> 00:00:32,684
Test.

16
00:00:32,884 --> 00:00:34,975
Let automated checks catch bugs first,

17
00:00:35,075 --> 00:00:37,080
with JUnit and SonarQube.

18
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:39,710
That is the Dev side.

19
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,497
Now, the Ops side.

20
00:00:42,347 --> 00:00:43,179
Release.

21
00:00:43,379 --> 00:00:45,278
Package the program so it can ship,

22
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:46,637
as a Docker image.

23
00:00:47,787 --> 00:00:48,619
Deploy.

24
00:00:48,819 --> 00:00:50,248
Run it for real users,

25
00:00:50,348 --> 00:00:52,545
on Kubernetes, installed with Helm.

26
00:00:53,895 --> 00:00:54,770
Operate.

27
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:57,082
Create and manage servers from code,

28
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:58,931
with Terraform and Ansible.

29
00:01:00,281 --> 00:01:01,049
Monitor.

30
00:01:01,249 --> 00:01:03,127
Watch the system, and learn from it,

31
00:01:03,227 --> 00:01:04,997
with Prometheus and Grafana.

32
00:01:07,547 --> 00:01:09,040
And then, the loop closes.

33
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:13,785
What you learn from monitoring becomes the next plan.

34
00:01:14,335 --> 00:01:17,258
Every lesson in this bootcamp lives somewhere on this loop.

35
00:01:19,608 --> 00:01:21,570
Learn the loop, and you learn DevOps.

36
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:23,922
Start with lesson one.
